(Japanese: '''{{j|ポケモンクイズパズルランド　ピカチュウのちょうせん！}}''' ''Pokémon Quiz Puzzle Land: Pikachu's Challenge!'') is a [[Pokémon manga]] composed by [[Hiroshi Takase]] and illustrated by [[Makoto Mizobuchi]]. It was serialized in the ''[[CoroCoro|CoroCoro Ichiban!]]'' magazine from the July 2015 issue (released on May 21, 2015)<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20160128140019/https://www.bookshop-ps.com/bsp/bsp_magcode?sha=1&sho=1385907115 ''CoroCoro Ichiban!'' July 2015 issue | Shogakukan BOOK SHOP] (Japanese; archived)</ref> to the December 2016 issue (released on October 21, 2016),<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20230818123056/https://www.bookshop-ps.com/bsp/bsp_magcode?sha=1&sho=1385912116 ''CoroCoro Ichiban!'' December 2016 issue | Shogakukan BOOK SHOP] (Japanese; archived)</ref> with a single chapter published in the issue 50 of ''{{OBP|Pokémon Fan|Japan}}'' (released on September 20, 2016).<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20240129025741/https://www.bookshop-ps.com/bsp/bsp_magcode?sha=1&sho=1386010116 ''Pokémon Fan'' 50 | Shogakukan BOOK SHOP] (Japanese; archived)</ref> The manga utilizes quizzes and puzzles as a method of storytelling. It is 160 pages long.

